    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70349" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεο-πρεπής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>befitting the young, youthful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					892d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>like a youth, extravagant,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. καὶ περίεργος,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐτελὴς καὶ ἀφελής,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.334c
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			).</div>
